d to an incident last  spring i do not have the particulars of  that incident right now  if you follow up with me i i can  ascertain exactly what the circumstances  i'll take one more question  uh mr dixon uh is currently uh on  administrative leave i believe  so you have to refer all questions  regarding his uh his employment with  them  to them so i at this point we're gonna  wrap up  the press conference i really appreciate  you all coming out as i said this has  been a rapid and fluent investigation  and we appreciate the support of the  media and appreciate the support of our  community  and we thank you all for coming out  foreign

